  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">這款超輕量的材質包專為注重風格、喝咖啡時會翹起小拇指的審美愛好者設計。</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">材質包僅包含一個紋理，但你無法想像它能如何改變遊戲世界！</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">如果你像我一樣厭惡那些可怕的圓形陰影，這個材質包就是為你準備的！</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/299/405/authentic-shadows.png\" width=\"427\" height=\"766\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">也試試：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/misty-world\" rel=\"nofollow\">Misty World</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/saltymod\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">SaltyMod</a> 和 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/masonry-blocks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Masonry Blocks</a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">還有我的新遊戲：<a href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.liahim85.puzzle26\" rel=\"nofollow\">26-PUZZLE</a>！！！</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/liahim\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://images.macrumors.com/t/mqZEotb5TSHKUv-i6SKmZrnbpFQ=/1600x0/article-new/2025/05/patreon.jpg\" width=\"250\" height=\"140\"></a></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbilling.sparkedhost.com%252faff.php%253faff%253d3128\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/b589f79a1e59fb2cc2b4e5cd31e9941a33b69746_0.webp\" width=\"900\" height=\"141\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
